      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yup. In any case, this change lgtm. And my gut feeling is that we can/should get rid of the tess shader experiments.",
      "parentUuid": "2220715c_b35ff65b",
      "revId": "fe0976d38b1ad52c1e6703219cdf0f6f1419a857",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
